# EAS upload ignore list. When this file exists, EAS does NOT also apply
# `.gitignore` — so keep it in sync, but intentionally allow Firebase client
# configs (`google-services.json`, `GoogleService-Info.plist`) into the archive
# for local/cloud builds when those files are present on disk.

